OL,3,GNEWSA'Speeding' jet-skiers stopped on
OL,4,Apopular lake
OL,5,
OL,6,FThree jet-skiers were stopped for
OL,7,Fallegedly speeding on a popular Lake
OL,8,FDistrict water, police have said.
OL,10,FCumbria Police and Lake District
OL,11,FNational Park rangers were carrying out
OL,12,Fpatrols on Coniston Water on Saturday
OL,13,Fwhen they received complaints a red jet
OL,14,Fski was being ridden at "excessive
OL,15,Fspeeds and putting other lake users at
OL,16,Frisk" on Saturday.
OL,18,FDetails of the two male riders were
OL,19,Fgained with a view of prosecuting the
OL,20,Fpair, the force said.
OL,23,APub: 06-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
