OL,3,GNEWSA'Speeding' jet-skiers stopped on
OL,4,Apopular lake
OL,5,
OL,6,FIn the same patrol, officers saw
OL,7,Fanother jet ski being "driven at
OL,8,Fexcessive speed". The rider was given a
OL,9,Fwarning letter advising them they could
OL,10,Fbe prosecuted if they were seen "riding
OL,11,Fin an antisocial manner" again.
